  "notes": "VDP — no bounty. Program launched Dec 2025, fresh low-coverage, 100% response efficiency. Open scope — accepts any Henkel-owned asset with impact. CRITICAL rules: (1) Any AI-generated report copy closed as N/A — every finding needs verified live evidence. (2) Version disclosure explicitly excluded. (3) XSS needs demonstrated business impact. (4) Subdomain takeover needs actual PoC claim. (5) Open redirect needs proven impact. High-value targets: SQLi, RCE, privilege escalation, personal data leakage, IDOR. China cluster (henkel.cn, magic-mirror.cn, eshop-henkel-adhesives.cn, schwarzkopfclub.com.cn) likely highest API attack surface. henkelgroup.cloud is cloud infra. raqn.io is internal digital platform. Program currently at 500 reports/90 days — active community."
